meta {
  name: Confirm a held appointment
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/appointments/:id/confirm
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id:
}

docs {
  Step 2 of the booking: turns the booker's `held` appointment into a `confirmed` one
  (`holdExpiresAt` becomes null). This is where payment authorization will run once
  payments ship; today confirmation is immediate.

  Idempotent — confirming an already-confirmed appointment returns it again (200).

  - 409 `HOLD_EXPIRED` — the checkout window lapsed; hold the slot again.
  - 409 `APPOINTMENT_STATE_INVALID` — it was cancelled in the meantime.
  - 404 — no such appointment booked by the caller.
}
